 text-anchor="middle">6</text><title>1191: The Third Crusade recovers Acre</title></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="507.5" x2="507.5" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="507.5" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="507.5" y="164" text-anchor="middle">7</text><title>1229: Frederick II regains Jerusalem by treaty</title></g><g class="rf-ev"><line x1="740.0" x2="740.0" y1="160" y2="166"/><circle cx="740.0" cy="160" r="8"/><text x="740.0" y="164" text-anchor="middle">8</text><title>1291: The Mamluks take Acre, ending the kingdom</title></g><text class="rf-axis" x="20" y="200">1099 CE</text><text class="rf-axis" x="740" y="200" text-anchor="end">1291 CE</text></svg><figcaption>Relative power on the Institute's 0–10 scale (each profile scaled to its own peak). Numbers mark the key events below.</figcaption></figure><ol class="rf-events"><li><span class="rf-year">1099</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/first-crusade">First Crusade</a> takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1100</span><span class="rf-text">Baldwin I is crowned the first king at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bethlehem">Bethlehem</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1124</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tyre">Tyre</a> falls to the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frankish-kingdom">Franks</a> and a Venetian fleet</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1177</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/baldwin-iv-of-jerusalem">Baldwin IV</a> defeats <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saladin">Saladin</a> at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-montgisard">Montgisard</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1187</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/saladin">Saladin</a> destroys the Frankish army at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-hattin">Hattin</a> and takes <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1191</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/third-crusade">Third Crusade</a> recovers <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/acre">Acre</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1229</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frederick-ii">Frederick II</a> regains <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/jerusalem">Jerusalem</a> by treaty</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">1291</span><span class="rf-text">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mamluk-sultanate">Mamluks</a> take <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/acre">Acre</a>, ending the kingdom</span></li></ol>
